  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Luis Amodio is a Mexican civil engineer and co-founder of Grupo Caabsa, the construction consortium he established with his brother Mauricio and other partners. Educated at Universidad La Salle, he built interests spanning building, infrastructure, property and concessions. The brothers became major shareholders in Spain’s OHLA, where Luis serves as chairman.",
    "html": "<p>Luis Amodio is a Mexican civil engineer and co-founder of Grupo Caabsa, the construction consortium he established with his brother Mauricio and other partners. Educated at Universidad La Salle, he built interests spanning building, infrastructure, property and concessions. The brothers became major shareholders in Spain’s OHLA, where Luis serves as chairman.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 51,
